       "applies_to": "this_plant",
       "group": "",
       "conditions": [],
       "hedged": true,
       "is_instruction": false
      },
      "decided": "unsure"
     },
     {
      "text": "Native to dry scrub in Africa and Asia, basil requires a lot of heat to thrive, and can be prone to downy mildew.",
